### Criar pedido
POST http://localhost:8080/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valorTotal": 150.50,
  "observacoes": "Pedido para teste"
}



### Consultar pedido
GET http://localhost:8080/pedidos/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Cancelar pedido
PATCH http://localhost:8080/pedidos/1/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Listar pedidos (Admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Buscar pedidos (Admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/pedidos/buscar?numero=202610
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Cancelar pedido (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/pedidos/6/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN